      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the vibe, but it's a bit too vague. I want to make it feel more grounded and visceral. Can you add more specific details about the people hanging out on the corners or walking the streets? I want to get a real sense of the demographic and the 'look' of the crowd that makes someone feel like they're in the wrong part of town. Make it feel authentic to that high-crime, inner-city setting.",
